==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|coagulate|ion}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|eɪʃən}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The [[precipitation]] of [[suspended]] [[particle]]s as they increase in size (by any of several physical or chemical processes)
# The [[process]] by which [[blood]] forms solid [[clot]]s.
# Similar solidification of other materials (e.g. of [[tofu]]).

====Antonyms====
* [[dissolution]]
* [[declumping]]
* [[peptization]]

====Related terms====
* [[coagulate]]

